<title>UK: Autumn start for Assoc British Ports terminal.</title>
<headline>Autumn start for Assoc British Ports terminal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated British Ports Holdings Plc said on Monday that first export deliveries would be made this autumn through its new steel terminal at the Port of Newport.</p>
<p>The UK ports group said work has begun on the 2.5 million stg facility which will provide 5,000 square metres of storage and be equipped with two 40 tonne gantry cranes.</p>
</text>
